&_nc_oc=AdnmTVsUv8PEM6cE2WAMd3d7TKW-RDgUQh_NAUyjOMhC9EPJNdl19mQtgM-FNOq0tr4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyMs7JXtTCwia6LlUKaiSm5dOpbM9rWbpbNebosioRuMg&oe=69BAAC9E"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "975198817093493", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566693_975198820426826_7097624739394196541_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tRRkiJhlnfEQ7kNvwGhyFY8&_nc_oc=Adle1IwXunJX7gjZTAJP6rw-jAM6XGP3y-NYWxswS_1SUviejR-__4rbvzlAr6kU0-4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwRQYDKwvS6e3xCUSYMpW2uEppLLuA5Paav95wRF0i3zQ&oe=69BAAE4C"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "415893571368646", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001715_415893574701979_3461447245540982035_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pOQ7o6VspH0Q7kNvwERs0MO&_nc_oc=AdmUmr1RlwYpjxiHb4rZA8Hs4mwblHQ5zk1xRCPkdGYoPiLOjvudvuz3m6xzF2WR_Jk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzG7gf06D2icLdOSg_TNwWw8Y1izD9aFxZBnLZyMjiBrA&oe=69BA9156"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "662596896051796", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974523_662596899385129_8527079563659693432_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IZ47_9IlmEcQ7kNvwF48BJ-&_nc_oc=AdkmRFs6eV84Ss96R0ydjMmUIs8ZX1I51qLLW52grkoHnDh1uGwUkJ8jxjQezp8eoSA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzyvk2xGHdouKBzokl6bx_oSVxqsM4-CP1NloGtvoK2TA&oe=69BA8FD4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "gameplayVR3.png", "id": "492345567046352", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974804_492345570379685_6511341930176300148_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N40YlYEMRyYQ7kNvwGVs-Q1&_nc_oc=AdmQuqqMsGltL8HeLQWA30H6_FWSb4RuN_B5fTDjNW95lWeo6CB74Os64PpdtzZTSNk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx4-_QuMy8xUt2zbPWJ_FIgFsVHNFRJnF-OB4aerVl94g&oe=69BA9B2D"}, "display_name": "Escape Simulator", "keywords": ["escape", "room", "coop", "multiplayer", "simulator"], "long_description": "Escape Simulator is a first-person puzzler you can **play solo or in an online co-op** (best with 2-3 players, but playable with up to 8!). Explore a growing set of **highly interactive escape rooms**. Pick up and examine everything, break objects, solve locks, and decipher puzzles to escape! After finishing the main game, watch for free content updates and explore rooms **built by our awesome community**.\n\n# \u2b50**REVIEWS** \n\"What I've seen has left me considerably impressed.\" - UploadVR\n\n# \u2692\ufe0f**COMMUNITY-MADE ROOMS**\nAfter finishing the main game **explore numerous rooms** built by our amazing community.\n\n# \ud83e\udd1d**ONLINE CO-OP**\nAll rooms are playable in an online co-op. Play with up to 8 players (best played with 2-3). Customize your character and join friends to solve puzzles together. More heads are better than one!\n\n# \ud83e\udde9**INTERACTIVE PUZZLES**\nExplore 28+ official rooms filled with puzzles designed by real-life escape room operators. If it\u2019s not nailed down, you can pick it up.\n\n# \ud83d\udd0d**EXEMINE EVERYTHING**\nRead books, examine ancient artifacts, and find clues to riddles. Need to cross-reference a clue? No problem - just pin it!\n\n# \ud83c\udfc6**WANT MORE?**\nThe game features additional content in the form of Addons with 4 large rooms each: \n- **Steampunk**: Solve four new rooms on the beautiful steampunk airship \"Valor.\"\n- **Wild West**: Become an outlaw in the Wild West.\n- **Magic**: Embrace your magic potential, and follow in the footsteps of great witches and wizards. \n\n", "short_description": "First-person puzzler you can play solo or in an online co-op. Explore a set of highly interactive escape rooms. Move furniture, pick up and examine everything, smash pots and break locks! Supports community rooms through the level editor."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://pinestudio.c